        "product_summary": "Two lining options: Choose the standard version or a plush-lined version for your seasonal assortment; each is identified in the colour selection.\nLace-up ankle design: Patterned round laces pass through metallic eyelets and the upper lace fitting along the raised front panel.\nMoulded side details: Three raised bars sit within the grained side panel between the black toe overlay and heel section.\nContrasting sole profile: Sculpted sidewalls and block-pattern tread complement the two-tone upper, with a rear fabric pull tab above the heel.\nThree colours across EU 39–46: Black, Army Green and Tan are each listed in Standard and Plush options, giving six selectable variants.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
